==id $Id: mailbox_lib.sfd $
* "mailbox.resource": only RawCommand(), the one function that every version has had. The ROM
* resource stays on the low level (the other functions are helpers for applications) and does
* not depend on a version newer than the first.
==base _MailboxBase
==basetype APTR
==libname mailbox
==include <exec/types.h>
==bias 6
==public
VOID MB_RawCommand(ULONG *command) (A0)
==end
